#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.quantile.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.quantile"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:1 of
msgid "Return values at the given quantile for each column."
msgstr "返回每列在给定分位数处的值。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.quantile.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Quantile(s) to compute, in the range ``[0, 1]``.  A scalar keeps original"
" column names; a list produces wide columns named ``{col}_q{pct}`` (e.g. "
"``a_q50`` for q=0.5)."
msgstr ""
"要计算的分位数，取值范围为 ``[0, 1]``。标量保持原始列名；列表会生成名为 `"
"`{col}_q{pct}`` 的宽列（例如 q=0.5 时为 ``a_q50``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:7 of
msgid "Interpolation method when the quantile lies between two data points."
msgstr "当分位数位于两个数据点之间时的插值方法。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:9 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, silently exclude non-numeric columns.  If ``False``, raise "
"``TypeError`` on non-numeric columns."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，静默排除非数值列。如果为 ``False``，遇到非数值列时抛出 `"
"`TypeError``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:12 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, use an approximate grid-summary sketch on the distributed "
"path (rank error ~1%).  NaNs are excluded in both modes; ±inf are kept "
"as valid order statistics in both modes."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，在分布式路径上使用近似的网格摘要草图（排名误差约 1%）。"
"两种模式下均排除 NaN；±inf 在两种模式下均保留为有效的顺序统计量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:16 of
msgid "Execution strategy for grouped/multi-chunk aggregation."
msgstr "分组/多分块聚合的执行策略。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.quantile.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.quantile.quantile:19 of
msgid ""
"One-row frame (whole-frame) or one-row-per-group frame with quantile "
"values per column."
msgstr "单行帧（全帧）或每组一行的帧，包含每列的分位数值。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.quantile.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

